# Context gathering

- Identify relevant files with search/symbols before opening files.
- Read only the sections needed for the change.
- Prefer ripgrep / semantic search over directory dumps.
- Ignore `node_modules`, build output, caches, binaries, and lockfile bodies unless required.
- Do not re-read files already in context.
